:pack   Treasure Trash — Act 1 (raccoon only, crow pinned)
:format 1
;
;  legend  # wall  - floor  @ raccoon  $ bag  C full can  c empty can  x spilled trash
;          E exit  + raccoon on exit  j water jug  S bag-on-can stack
;          W wheelie bin (full)  w wheelie bin (empty)  B recycle bin (full)
;          b recycle bin (empty)  F G H K M N furniture
;
; Terrain rides in a separate aligned :water block — ~ open canal, = filled in (floor),
; - dry. There is no glyph for anything on an exit. Format spec: FORMATS.md.
;
; Every field below is machine-checked by tools/verify.mjs — :par must be the provably
; minimal solve, :solve must replay to a win in exactly :par actions, and :traps must
; equal the number of legal actions that lead to an unwinnable board.

:level  L0
:name   Out
:teach  the exit
:par    2
:traps  0
:solves 1
:solve  uu
:note   No bags, so the exit is live from move one. Walk forward and leave.
:grid
#E#
#-#
#@#
:end

:level  L1
:name   Pounce
:teach  directional pounce, the fan, permanent mess
:arm    on
:par    4
:traps  0
:solves 1
:solve  uU!dr
:note   The down-strike is refused: its fan would land on the exit at (3,3).
:grid
---
-$-
--E
#@#
:end

