:level  L15
:name   Two Crossings
:teach  both crossings, and that the one you built first is the one you can afford to bury
:par    8
:traps  7
:solves 1
:solve  L!rR!uulL!r
:note   Three bags and two of them are spent on the canal, so the fans you have left are the whole budget. You build both crossings, walk over the east one, and then bury the west one with the last tear because by then you are done with it. NOTE: this room asked WHICH BAG FIRST until bridges became ordinary floor; the order metric now reads 2/2 and the question is gone. It wants re-picking.
